Package: mymqttx
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Maintainer: MyMQTTX <dev@localhost>
Description: Lightweight MQTT test bench for Agent development
 MyMQTTX is a dependency-free local MQTT client with a browser-based UI.
 It supports publishing and subscribing to Agent-related MQTT topics and
 stores per-user settings in ~/.config/mymqttx.
